        "b": 755.7829409281768
      },
      "content": "Notice When operating the Machine."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0148",
      "reading_order": 171,
      "section": "2. General Safety Precautions",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 92.219514,
        "t": 747.674768,
        "r": 344.5752180000006,
        "b": 738.8030489281768
      },
      "content": "Before operating the machine, make sure the followings."
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "id": "fig_0022",
      "reading_order": 172,
      "section": "2. General Safety Precautions",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 101.25660705566406,
        "t": 709.4801788330078,
        "r": 220.3636474609375,
        "b": 670.0347747802734
      },
      "image_path": "figures/figure_0022.png",
      "previous_block_id": "txt_0148",
      "next_block_id": "txt_0149",
      "image_hash": "4b01b102e8dd70f92b71374938569a6b04300f31240a61a9eaf8cf318c852491",
      "width": 119,
      "height": 39
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0149",
      "reading_order": 173,
      "section": "2. General Safety Precautions",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 92.219514,
        "t": 643.6947680000001,
        "r": 525.8249939999998,
        "b": 634.823048928177
      },
      "content": "Always close the door of the Electric Control Panel to avoid damage due to water, chip or oil."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0150",
      "reading_order": 174,
      "section": "2. General Safety Precautions",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 92.219514,
        "t": 439.69558400000017,
        "r": 527.1666719999997,
        "b": 413.78385292817694
      },
      "content": "It  is  dangerous  to  remove  the  chip  attached  or  dropped  to  the  tool  with  bare  hands. Therefore, stop the machine and wear gloves and then do a job using brush."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0151",
      "reading_order": 175,
      "section": "2. General Safety Precautions",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 92.220516,
        "t": 218.6563880000001,
        "r": 379.6321920000001,
        "b": 209.78466892817687
      },
      "content": "Do not adjust the location of coolant nozzle while operating."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0152",
      "reading_order": 176,
      "section": "2. General Safety Precautions",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 92.220516,
        "t": 201.67649600000016,
        "r": 527.2167719999998,
        "b": 158.78487292817692
      },
      "content": "Gradually increase the rpm of spindle to allow sufficient warming-up. Otherwise, it may result in  damage  of  the  chuck  cylinder  (Refer  to  Repair  and  Preservation,  step  2-9/5-1par.  \"A. Warm up of spindle\" )."
    },
